@startuml
'数据交互时序图'
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
<style>
element {
  BackGroundColor: #f0f0f0
}
 sequenceDiagram {
    participant {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
      LineColor: #000;
      HorizontalAlignment: left;
    }
    note {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
    }
    arrow {
      FontColor: black;
      LineColor: black;
    }
  }
</style>
title 数据交互时序图
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence right
participant Page [
    = TravelPlannerPage
    ----
    旅行规划页面
       1、初始化GoogleGenerativeAiClient
       2、初始化Conversation
       3、初始化SurfaceController
       4、初始化A2uiTransportAdapter
]
participant Conversation [
    =Conversation
    ----
     GenUI对话管理器
]
participant Controller [
    =SurfaceController
    ----
     GenUI控制器
]

participant Adapter [
    =A2uiTransportAdapter
    ----
     GenUI和AI服务之间消息适配器
]
participant Parser [
    =A2uiParserTransformer
    ----
     字符串解析器
]
participant Client [
    = GoogleGenerativeAiClient
    ----
     Google Cloud生成内容的客户端
]
participant GenerativeServiceInterface [
    = GoogleGenerativeServiceInterface
    ----
     GenUI服务
]
participant GenerativeService [
    = GenerativeService
    ----
     GenUI服务
]

autonumber 1
Page -> Client: sendRequest
activate Page
activate Client
autonumber 2
Client ->Client:_generate:组装请求数据\n\t\t及发送网络请求,接收响应
autonumber 3
Client -> GenerativeServiceInterface++: generateContent
autonumber 4
GenerativeServiceInterface -> GenerativeService++:generateContent:发送请求
return GenerateContentResponse
return GenerateContentResponse
autonumber 6
group 6.1 addFunctionCall
    autonumber 6.1
    Client ->Client:<<functionCalls.isNotEmpty>> call->_processFunctionCalls
    autonumber 6.1.1
    Client ->Client :emitEvent:发送AiGenerationEvent事件
end
deactivate Client
group 6.2 addChunk
    autonumber 6.2
    Client o-> Adapter :<<functionCalls.isEmpty>> call addChunk:是文本调用addChunk方法
    activate Adapter
    group 6.2.1 文本消息
        autonumber 6.2.1
        Adapter->Parser:调用addChunk方法触发\n_onData方法解析数据转成事件
        activate Parser
        autonumber 6.2.1.1
        Parser->Parser:_onData
        autonumber 6.2.1.2
        Parser->Parser:_processBuffer
        autonumber 6.2.1.3
        Parser->Parser:__emitText
        autonumber 6.2.1.4
        Parser -> Adapter:将文本添加到_pipeline
        autonumber 6.2.1.5
        Adapter -> Conversation:触发_textSubscription订阅，发送ConversationEvent事件
         activate Conversation
    end
    group 6.2.2 A2UI消息
        autonumber 6.2.2
        Parser->Parser:_emitMessage
        autonumber 6.2.2.1
        Parser ->Adapter:触发_pipeline.listen更新_messageStream
        deactivate Parser
        autonumber 6.2.2.2
        Adapter -> Conversation:触发_transportSubscription订阅
        deactivate Adapter
        autonumber 6.2.2.3
        Conversation-> Controller:handleMessage
        activate Controller
        autonumber 6.2.2.4
        Controller -> Controller:_handleMessageInternal更新_registry
        autonumber 6.2.2.5
        Controller -> Controller:_registry.updateSurface/removeSurface更新_registry
        autonumber 6.2.2.6
        Controller -> Controller:_registry.events:返回SurfaceUpdate类型
        autonumber 6.2.2.7
        Controller -> Conversation:触发_engineSubscription订阅
        deactivate Controller
        autonumber 6.2.2.8
        Conversation -> Conversation:发送ConversationEvent事件

    end
end
group 6.3 addA2uiMessage
    autonumber 6.3
    Client o->Adapter :<<functionCalls.isEmpty>>call addMessage:是A2uiMessage调用addMessage
    activate Adapter
    autonumber 6.3.1
    Adapter->Conversation:调用addMessage方法将触发\n_transportSubscription订阅事件
    deactivate Adapter
    autonumber 6.3.2
    Conversation->Controller:handleMessage
    activate Controller
    autonumber 6.3.3
    Controller->Controller:_handleMessageInternal更新_registry
    autonumber 6.3.4
    Controller -> Controller:_registry.updateSurface/removeSurface更新_registry
    autonumber 6.3.5
    Controller -> Controller:_registry.events:返回SurfaceUpdate类型
    autonumber 6.3.6
    Controller -> Conversation:触发_engineSubscription订阅
    deactivate Controller
    autonumber 6.3.7
    Conversation -> Conversation:发送ConversationEvent事件

end
autonumber 7
Conversation-> Page
deactivate Conversation
autonumber 8
Page -> Page:_uiConversation.events.listen
autonumber 9
Page -> Page:_messages:更新UI
note over Page :更新UI
deactivate Page
@enduml


@startuml
'UI渲染时序图'
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
<style>
element {
  BackGroundColor: #f0f0f0
}
 sequenceDiagram {
    participant {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
      LineColor: #000;
      HorizontalAlignment: left;
    }
    note {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
    }
    arrow {
      FontColor: black;
      LineColor: black;
    }
  }
</style>
title UI渲染时序图
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
participant Conversation [
    =Conversation
    ----
    聊天列表
]
participant ChatMessageView [
    =ChatMessageView
    ----
    文本消息
]
participant InternalMessageView [
    =InternalMessageView
    ----
    系统消息
]
participant Surface [
    =Surface
    ----
    组件渲染
]
participant Catalog [
    =Catalog
    ----
    组件集合
]
participant CatalogItem [
    =CatalogItem
    ----
    组件声明
]
Conversation -> Conversation++: build
Conversation ->Conversation: _buildUserMessage: 构建用户消息
Conversation -> ChatMessageView++:构建用户消息
return Widget
Conversation ->Conversation:_buildSystemMessage: 构建系统消息
Conversation -> InternalMessageView++:构建系统消息
return Widget
Conversation ->Conversation:__buildModelMessage: 构建模型消息
Conversation ->Surface++:构建Surface动态界面的控件
Surface -> Surface:_findCatalogForDefinition:获取root组件Catalog
group 组件构建并递归构建子组件
    Surface -> Surface: _buildWidget
    Surface -> Catalog++:buildWidget：根据组件定义类型（type）获取组件
    Catalog -> CatalogItem ++:widgetBuilder:构建对应组件
    CatalogItem -> CatalogItemContext ++ :buildChild:构建子组件
    CatalogItemContext -> Surface:_buildWidget
end
Surface -> ChatMessageView++:构建用户消息
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
@enduml